{"id":"wb-7-861","name":"太原大关帝庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"大关帝庙","text":"大关帝庙，位于山西省太原市迎泽区庙前街道前社区庙前街36号（北段），是中华人民共和国全国重点文物保护单位之一。\n大关帝庙为太原城内二十七座关帝庙中规模最大的一座，故称大关帝庙。老城区内现存的关帝庙尚有西校尉营古关帝庙、南肖墙关帝庙、等。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%A7%E5%85%B3%E5%B8%9D%E5%BA%99","revisionId":86475339,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86475339","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/d8a30a1b2b2e1fbc835a105c.jpg","title":"Taiyuanguandimiao.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Taiyuanguandimiao.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1b/Taiyuanguandimiao.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Brookqi","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​山西太原大关帝庙","width":320,"height":212}}